{
  "title": "📊 Graphical Method — When Lines Meet (or Don't!)",
  "hook": "Imagine two friends walking on straight paths on a football field. Will they bump into each other? It depends on their paths! If the paths cross, there's one meeting point. If the paths are parallel, they'll never meet. And if they're on the same path — they'll always be together. This is exactly how pairs of linear equations work!",
  "explanation": "<p>Each linear equation <b>a₁x + b₁y = c₁</b> represents a straight line. A <em>pair</em> of such equations gives two lines. Three possibilities:</p><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:12px 0;font-size:0.88rem\"><tr><th style=\"background:#E3F2FD;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #BBDEFB;text-align:left;font-weight:700\">Type</th><th style=\"background:#E3F2FD;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #BBDEFB;text-align:left;font-weight:700\">Lines</th><th style=\"background:#E3F2FD;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #BBDEFB;text-align:left;font-weight:700\">Condition</th><th style=\"background:#E3F2FD;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #BBDEFB;text-align:left;font-weight:700\">Solutions</th><th style=\"background:#E3F2FD;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #BBDEFB;text-align:left;font-weight:700\">Consistency</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Intersecting</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Cross at one point</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">a₁/a₂ ≠ b₁/b₂</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Exactly 1</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Consistent</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Parallel</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Never meet</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">a₁/a₂ = b₁/b₂ ≠ c₁/c₂</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">0</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Inconsistent</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Coincident</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Same line</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">a₁/a₂ = b₁/b₂ = c₁/c₂</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Infinite</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Dependent</td></tr></table><br><b>Checking without graphing:</b> For a₁x + b₁y = c₁ and a₂x + b₂y = c₂, compare the ratios:<div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#E3F2FD,#BBDEFB);border-left:4px solid #1565C0;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px;margin:12px 0;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:1.05rem;text-align:center\"><div style=\"font-size:0.7rem;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#1565C0;margin-bottom:4px\">Consistency Test</div><strong>Compare a₁/a₂, b₁/b₂, and c₁/c₂</strong></div><svg width=\"260\" height=\"200\" style=\"display:block;margin:10px auto;background:#FAFAFA;border-radius:8px\"><line x1=\"30.0\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"30.0\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"30.0\" y=\"131.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">-4</text><line x1=\"50.0\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"50.0\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"50.0\" y=\"131.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">-3</text><line x1=\"70.0\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"70.0\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"70.0\" y=\"131.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">-2</text><line x1=\"90.0\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"90.0\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"131.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">-1</text><line x1=\"110.0\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"110.0\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"130.0\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"130.0\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"130.0\" y=\"131.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">1</text><line x1=\"150.0\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"150.0\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"131.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">2</text><line x1=\"170.0\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"170.0\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"131.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">3</text><line x1=\"190.0\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"190.0\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"190.0\" y=\"131.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">4</text><line x1=\"210.0\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"210.0\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"210.0\" y=\"131.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">5</text><line x1=\"230.0\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"230.0\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"230.0\" y=\"131.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">6</text><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"170.0\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"170.0\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"102.0\" y=\"174.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">-3</text><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"152.5\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"152.5\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"102.0\" y=\"156.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">-2</text><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"135.0\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"135.0\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"102.0\" y=\"139.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">-1</text><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"117.5\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"100.0\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"100.0\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"102.0\" y=\"104.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">1</text><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"82.5\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"82.5\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"102.0\" y=\"86.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">2</text><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"65.0\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"65.0\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"102.0\" y=\"69.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">3</text><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"47.5\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"47.5\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"102.0\" y=\"51.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">4</text><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"30.0\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"30.0\" stroke=\"#E0E0E0\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"102.0\" y=\"34.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#666\">5</text><text x=\"235\" y=\"121.5\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\">x</text><text x=\"115.0\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\">y</text><line x1=\"50.0\" y1=\"47.5\" x2=\"210.0\" y2=\"152.5\" stroke=\"#E65100\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"50.0\" y1=\"135.0\" x2=\"210.0\" y2=\"65.0\" stroke=\"#1565C0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"150.0\" cy=\"108.75\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2E7D32\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"157.0\" y=\"103.75\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2E7D32\">Solution</text></svg><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:0.8rem;color:#666\">Two intersecting lines → unique solution at the crossing point</div>",
  "worked_example": "<b>Example:</b> Check the consistency of: 2x + 3y = 7 and 4x + 6y = 10.<br><br><div style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A90D9;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem\">1</div><div><strong>Identify coefficients</strong><br><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:0.88rem\">a₁=2, b₁=3, c₁=7 and a₂=4, b₂=6, c₂=10</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A90D9;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem\">2</div><div><strong>Compute ratios</strong><br><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:0.88rem\">a₁/a₂ = 2/4 = 1/2, b₁/b₂ = 3/6 = 1/2, c₁/c₂ = 7/10</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A90D9;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem\">3</div><div><strong>Compare</strong><br><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:0.88rem\">a₁/a₂ = b₁/b₂ = 1/2, but c₁/c₂ = 7/10 ≠ 1/2</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A90D9;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem\">4</div><div><strong>Conclude</strong><br><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:0.88rem\">Since a₁/a₂ = b₁/b₂ ≠ c₁/c₂ → Parallel lines → No solution (Inconsistent)</span></div></div></div>",
  "try_this": {
    "question": "Check the consistency of: x + 2y = 4 and 3x + 6y = 12. How many solutions?",
    "hint": "Compare a₁/a₂, b₁/b₂, c₁/c₂.",
    "answer": "a₁/a₂ = 1/3, b₁/b₂ = 2/6 = 1/3, c₁/c₂ = 4/12 = 1/3. All ratios equal → coincident lines → infinitely many solutions."
  },
  "fun_fact": "In 3D, instead of two lines, you'd have two planes — they can intersect in a line, be parallel, or be the same plane!"
}